    "demo.aiAgent.content": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "# What is an AI Agent?\n\nAn AI Agent is an intelligent entity that perceives its environment, reasons, and takes actions to achieve goals. Unlike traditional [[Large Language Models (LLM)]], which only chat, Agents have the power to 'act'.\n\n## Core Formula\n**Agent = LLM + [[Planning]] + [[Memory]] + [[Tool Use]]**\n\nFrameworks: AutoGPT, BabyAGI, LangChain"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "# 什么是 AI Agent？\n\nAI Agent (人工智能代理) 是指能够感知环境、进行推理并采取行动以实现目标的智能体。不同于传统的 [[大语言模型 (LLM)]] 仅能进行对话，Agent 具备了“行动力”。\n\n## 核心公式\n**Agent = LLM + [[规划 (Planning)]] + [[记忆 (Memory)]] + [[工具使用 (Tool Use)]]**\n\n相关框架：AutoGPT, BabyAGI, LangChain"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "# 什麼是 AI Agent？\n\nAI Agent (人工智能代理) 是指能够感知環境、進行推理並采取行動以實現目標的智能體。不同於傳統的 [[大語言模型 (LLM)]] 仅能進行對話，Agent 具備了“行動力”。\n\n## 核心公式\n**Agent = LLM + [[規劃 (Planning)]] + [[記憶 (Memory)]] + [[工具使用 (Tool Use)]]**\n\n相關框架：AutoGPT, BabyAGI, LangChain"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "# What is an AI Agent?\n\nAn AI Agent is an intelligent entity that perceives its environment, reasons, and takes actions to achieve goals. Unlike traditional [[Large Language Models (LLM)]], which only chat, Agents have the power to 'act'.\n\n## Core Formula\n**Agent = LLM + [[Planning]] + [[Memory]] + [[Tool Use]]**\n\nFrameworks: AutoGPT, BabyAGI, LangChain"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "# What is an AI Agent?\n\nAn AI Agent is an intelligent entity that perceives its environment, reasons, and takes actions to achieve goals. Unlike traditional [[Large Language Models (LLM)]], which only chat, Agents have the power to 'act'.\n\n## Core Formula\n**Agent = LLM + [[Planning]] + [[Memory]] + [[Tool Use]]**\n\nFrameworks: AutoGPT, BabyAGI, LangChain"
          }
        },
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "# What is an AI Agent?\n\nAn AI Agent is an intelligent entity that perceives its environment, reasons, and takes actions to achieve goals. Unlike traditional [[Large Language Models (LLM)]], which only chat, Agents have the power to 'act'.\n\n## Core Formula\n**Agent = LLM + [[Planning]] + [[Memory]] + [[Tool Use]]**\n\nFrameworks: AutoGPT, BabyAGI, LangChain"
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "# What is an AI Agent?\n\nAn AI Agent is an intelligent entity that perceives its environment, reasons, and takes actions to achieve goals. Unlike traditional [[Large Language Models (LLM)]], which only chat, Agents have the power to 'act'.\n\n## Core Formula\n**Agent = LLM + [[Planning]] + [[Memory]] + [[Tool Use]]**\n\nFrameworks: AutoGPT, BabyAGI, LangChain"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "# What is an AI Agent?\n\nAn AI Agent is an intelligent entity that perceives its environment, reasons, and takes actions to achieve goals. Unlike traditional [[Large Language Models (LLM)]], which only chat, Agents have the power to 'act'.\n\n## Core Formula\n**Agent = LLM + [[Planning]] + [[Memory]] + [[Tool Use]]**\n\nFrameworks: AutoGPT, BabyAGI, LangChain"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "# What is an AI Agent?\n\nAn AI Agent is an intelligent entity that perceives its environment, reasons, and takes actions to achieve goals. Unlike traditional [[Large Language Models (LLM)]], which only chat, Agents have the power to 'act'.\n\n## Core Formula\n**Agent = LLM + [[Planning]] + [[Memory]] + [[Tool Use]]**\n\nFrameworks: AutoGPT, BabyAGI, LangChain"
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "# What is an AI Agent?\n\nAn AI Agent is an intelligent entity that perceives its environment, reasons, and takes actions to achieve goals. Unlike traditional [[Large Language Models (LLM)]], which only chat, Agents have the power to 'act'.\n\n## Core Formula\n**Agent = LLM + [[Planning]] + [[Memory]] + [[Tool Use]]**\n\nFrameworks: AutoGPT, BabyAGI, LangChain"
          }
        }
      }
    },
