    "demo.memory.content": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "# Memory\n\nMemory enables the Agent to maintain contextual consistency:\n\n- **Short-term Memory**: Uses the [[Large Language Model (LLM)]]'s context window for the current task.\n- **Long-term Memory**: Uses external storage (e.g., [[Vector Database]]) for information retrieval.\n\n[[AI Agent: The Brain Beyond Chat]] uses long-term memory for knowledge accumulation across sessions."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "# 记忆 (Memory)\n\n记忆能力让 Agent 能够保持上下文连贯性：\n\n- **短期记忆**: 利用 [[大语言模型 (LLM)]] 的上下文窗口记录当前任务。\n- **长期记忆**: 利用外部存储 (如 [[向量数据库]]) 进行信息检索。\n\n[[AI Agent：超越对话的大脑]] 利用长期记忆来实现跨会话的知识沉淀。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "# 記憶 (Memory)\n\n記憶能力讓 Agent 能够保持上下文連贯性：\n\n- **短期記憶**: 利用 [[大語言模型 (LLM)]] 的上下文視窗記錄当前任務。\n- **長期記憶**: 利用外部存储 (如 [[向量資料庫]]) 進行資訊检索。\n\n[[AI Agent：超越對話的大脑]] 利用長期記憶來實現跨會話的知識沉淀。"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "# Memory\n\nMemory enables the Agent to maintain contextual consistency:\n\n- **Short-term Memory**: Uses the [[Large Language Model (LLM)]]'s context window for the current task.\n- **Long-term Memory**: Uses external storage (e.g., [[Vector Database]]) for information retrieval.\n\n[[AI Agent: The Brain Beyond Chat]] uses long-term memory for knowledge accumulation across sessions."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "# Memory\n\nMemory enables the Agent to maintain contextual consistency:\n\n- **Short-term Memory**: Uses the [[Large Language Model (LLM)]]'s context window for the current task.\n- **Long-term Memory**: Uses external storage (e.g., [[Vector Database]]) for information retrieval.\n\n[[AI Agent: The Brain Beyond Chat]] uses long-term memory for knowledge accumulation across sessions."
          }
        },
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
