            "value": "# Memory\n\nMemory enables the Agent to maintain contextual consistency:\n\n- **Short-term Memory**: Uses the [[Large Language Model (LLM)]]'s context window for the current task.\n- **Long-term Memory**: Uses external storage (e.g., [[Vector Database]]) for information retrieval.\n\n[[AI Agent: The Brain Beyond Chat]] uses long-term memory for knowledge accumulation across sessions."
          }
        },
