    "demo.toolUse.content": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "# Tool Use / Tool Calling\n\nTool use is the bridge for an Agent to interact with the real world. Agents can call APIs for:\n\n- **Real-time Search**: Get latest news.\n- **Code Execution**: Perform complex calculations.\n- **File Operations**: Process local documents.\n\nThis makes [[AI Agent: The Brain Beyond Chat]] truly capable of solving real-world problems."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "# 工具使用 (Tool Use / Tool Calling)\n\n工具使用是 Agent 与现实世界交互的桥梁。Agent 可以通过 API 调用：\n\n- **实时搜索**: 获取最新资讯。\n- **代码执行**: 进行复杂的数学运算。\n- **文件操作**: 处理本地文档。\n\n这让 [[AI Agent：超越对话的大脑]] 真正具备了解决实际问题的能力。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "# 工具使用 (Tool Use / Tool Calling)\n\n工具使用是 Agent 与現實世界交互的橋梁。Agent 可以通過 API 調用：\n\n- **實時搜尋**: 獲取最新資訊。\n- **程式碼執行**: 進行複雜的數學運算。\n- **檔案操作**: 處理本地文档。\n\n這讓 [[AI Agent：超越對話的大脑]] 真正具備了解決實际問題的能力。"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "# Tool Use / Tool Calling\n\nTool use is the bridge for an Agent to interact with the real world. Agents can call APIs for:\n\n- **Real-time Search**: Get latest news.\n- **Code Execution**: Perform complex calculations.\n- **File Operations**: Process local documents.\n\nThis makes [[AI Agent: The Brain Beyond Chat]] truly capable of solving real-world problems."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
