    "demo.snippet.methodology": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "# 🧠 Personal Knowledge Graph & Second Brain Construction Guide\n\n> Grounded in Andrej Karpathy's LLM Wiki methodology, this guide outlines how to synthesize fragmented notes into a highly connected personal knowledge graph.\n\n## 1. Core Architectural Principles\n\n1. **Atomicity**: Each note encapsulates exactly one core concept to facilitate AI context injection and vector retrieval.\n2. **Bi-directional Linking**: Explicitly connect concepts using `[[Note Title]]` syntax (e.g., [[Atomic Deconstruction of Notes]] and [[Value of Bi-directional Links]]).\n\n## 2. The CODE Knowledge Pipeline\n\n| Stage | Action | Core Activity | System Capability |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **Capture** | Collect | Record voice memos, web clips, and OCR scans | Voice Notes & OCR |\n| **Organize** | Structurize | Categorize by domains and apply semantic tags | Tag Matrix |\n| **Distill** | Summarize | Apply progressive highlighting & executive bullet points | Progressive Summary |\n| **Express** | Create | Synthesize structured papers & research reports | AI Synthesis Lab |\n\n## 3. Progressive Distillation & RAG Precision\n\nWithin the RAG pipeline, high-quality [[Progressive Summarization Analysis]] significantly elevates Vector DB Top-K retrieval precision, eliminating LLM hallucinations."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "# 🧠 个人知识图谱与数字外脑构建指南\n\n> 本指南基于 Andrej Karpathy 的 LLM Wiki 方法论，旨在指导如何将碎片化信息转化为高度连结的个人知识网状图谱。\n\n## 一、 核心构建原则\n\n1. **原子化拆解 (Atomicity)**：单张卡片仅承载一个核心概念，避免跨主题的长篇大论，方便后续被 AI 检索并作为 Context 上下文注入。\n2. **网状双向链接 (Bi-directional Links)**：使用 `[[卡片名称]]` 显式建立词条间的双向关联（例如 [[笔记的原子化解构]] 与 [[双向链接的价值]]）。\n\n## 二、 知识流转四阶段模型 (CODE 流程)\n\n| 阶段 | 英文名称 | 核心动作 | 对应工具/能力 |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **捕获** | Capture | 随时记录灵感、语音速记与剪贴板 | 语音速记、OCR 扫描 |\n| **组织** | Organize | 按主题与领域分类，打上语义标签 | 标签矩阵、自动分类 |\n| **提炼** | Distill | 逐层高亮加粗，撰写摘要句 | 渐进式总结 |\n| **表达** | Express | 组织合成新文档与论文 | AI 智合实验室 |\n\n## 三、 渐进式总结与 RAG 召回\n\n在知识检索（RAG）闭环中，高质量的 [[渐进式总结对比分析]] 能够大幅提升向量数据库（Vector DB）的 Top-K 召回精准度，克服大模型回答中的幻觉问题。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "# 🧠 个人知识图谱与数字外脑构建指南\n\n> 本指南基于 Andrej Karpathy 的 LLM Wiki 方法论，旨在指导如何将碎片化信息转化为高度连结的个人知识网状图谱。\n\n## 一、 核心构建原则\n\n1. **原子化拆解 (Atomicity)**：单张卡片仅承载一个核心概念，避免跨主题的长篇大论，方便后续被 AI 检索并作为 Context 上下文注入。\n2. **网状双向链接 (Bi-directional Links)**：使用 `[[卡片名称]]` 显式建立词条间的双向关联（例如 [[笔记的原子化解构]] 与 [[双向链接的价值]]）。\n\n## 二、 知识流转四阶段模型 (CODE 流程)\n\n| 阶段 | 英文名称 | 核心动作 | 对应工具/能力 |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **捕获** | Capture | 随时记录灵感、语音速记与剪贴板 | 语音速记、OCR 扫描 |\n| **组织** | Organize | 按主题与领域分类，打上语义标签 | 标签矩阵、自动分类 |\n| **提炼** | Distill | 逐层高亮加粗，撰写摘要句 | 渐进式总结 |\n| **表达** | Express | 组织合成新文档与论文 | AI 智合实验室 |\n\n## 三、 渐进式总结与 RAG 召回\n\n在知识检索（RAG）闭环中，高质量的 [[渐进式总结对比分析]] 能够大幅提升向量数据库（Vector DB）的 Top-K 召回精准度，克服大模型回答中的幻觉问题。"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "# 🧠 Personal Knowledge Graph & Second Brain Construction Guide\n\n> Grounded in Andrej Karpathy's LLM Wiki methodology, this guide outlines how to synthesize fragmented notes into a highly connected personal knowledge graph.\n\n## 1. Core Architectural Principles\n\n1. **Atomicity**: Each note encapsulates exactly one core concept to facilitate AI context injection and vector retrieval.\n2. **Bi-directional Linking**: Explicitly connect concepts using `[[Note Title]]` syntax (e.g., [[Atomic Deconstruction of Notes]] and [[Value of Bi-directional Links]]).\n\n## 2. The CODE Knowledge Pipeline\n\n| Stage | Action | Core Activity | System Capability |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **Capture** | Collect | Record voice memos, web clips, and OCR scans | Voice Notes & OCR |\n| **Organize** | Structurize | Categorize by domains and apply semantic tags | Tag Matrix |\n| **Distill** | Summarize | Apply progressive highlighting & executive bullet points | Progressive Summary |\n| **Express** | Create | Synthesize structured papers & research reports | AI Synthesis Lab |\n\n## 3. Progressive Distillation & RAG Precision\n\nWithin the RAG pipeline, high-quality [[Progressive Summarization Analysis]] significantly elevates Vector DB Top-K retrieval precision, eliminating LLM hallucinations."
          }
        },
