    "demo.snippet.pkmVoiceForget": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "🎙️ Voice-to-Text Transcript [Recording Duration: 02:15 | Accuracy Confidence: 99.1%]\n\n## 1. Cognitive Psychology & Forgetting Curve Notes\n\n- **Ebbinghaus Forgetting Curve**: Memory decay is steepest within the first 24 hours (losing nearly 70% of detail). Spaced repetition must be scheduled at Day 1, Day 3, and Day 7.\n- **PKM Integration**: In [[Personal Knowledge Graph Guide]], avoid the \"Collector's Fallacy\". Ideas captured via voice notes must be refactored into [[Atomic Deconstruction of Notes]] cards within 48 hours.\n\n## 2. Action Items\n\n1. Cross-reference this transcript with [[Feynman Technique Practice]].\n2. Supplement experimental data on Active Recall in [[Progressive Summarization Analysis]].\n3. Audit unlinked orphan nodes in the active Vault."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "🎙️ 语音转文字速记 [录音时长: 02:15 | 识别置信度: 99.1%]\n\n## 1. 认知心理学与遗忘曲线笔记\n\n- **艾宾浩斯遗忘曲线规律**：学习新知识后，24 小时内遗忘速度最快（会丢失近 70% 的记忆细节）。必须在第 1 天、第 3 天和第 7 天安排间隔复习。\n- **与 PKM 图谱的结合**：在 [[个人知识图谱指南]] 中，不能只做被动收集（Collector's Fallacy）。语音速记捕获的灵感必须在 48 小时内整理成 [[笔记的原子化解构]] 卡片。\n\n## 2. 待办行动点 (Action Items)\n\n1. 将本条语音转文字文本与 [[费曼学习法实践]] 进行交叉引用。\n2. 在 [[渐进式总结对比分析]] 中补充“主动召回 (Active Recall)”对减缓遗忘曲线的实验数据。\n3. 检查当前 Vault 中未打标签的孤立节点。"
          }
        },
