    "demo.snippet.coffeeOcrManual": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "📷 OCR Text Extraction [Confidence: 99.4% | Source Image: Roast_Level_Diagram.png]\n\n## Coffee Bean Roasting Stages & Flavor Evolution Curve\n\nCoffee beans undergo dehydration, First Crack, Maillard reaction, and Second Crack during roasting. Flavor profiles vary significantly across roast spectrums:\n\n| Roast Level | English Designation | Key Flavor Attributes | Acidity / Bitterness | Recommended Brewing |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **Light Roast** | Light / Cinnamon | Floral, citrus, bright crisp acidity | High acidity, minimal bitterness | Pour-over, Syphon |\n| **Medium Roast** | Medium / City | Nutty, caramel, balanced chocolate | Balanced acidity & sweetness | Americano, SOE Espresso |\n| **Dark Roast** | Dark / French | Smoky, dark cocoa, rich body | Low acidity, pronounced bold bitter | Cold Drip, Milk Espresso |\n\n> 💡 **RAG Cross-reference**: When matching roast curves for bean procurement, cross-check against [[Roasting Factory & Origin Sourcing]] and the Dial-in table in [[Coffee Shop Daily Operations Manual]]."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "📷 OCR 图文识别文本 [识别置信度: 99.4% | 原图来源: 咖啡豆烘焙度图鉴.png]\n\n## 咖啡豆烘焙阶段与风味演变曲线\n\n咖啡豆在烘焙过程中经历脱水、一爆（First Crack）、美拉德反应与二爆（Second Crack），不同烘焙程度的风味表现差异巨大：\n\n| 烘焙程度 | 英文名称 | 核心风味特征 | 酸度/苦度表现 | 适合萃取方式 |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **浅度烘焙** | Light / Cinnamon | 花香、柑橘、高锐度果酸 | 高酸度、极低苦度 | 手冲、虹吸壶 |\n| **中度烘焙** | Medium / City | 坚果、焦糖、巧克力平衡 | 中等酸度、适中甜感 | 美式、SOE 意式 |\n| **深度烘焙** | Dark / French | 烟熏、可可、香料、油脂丰富 | 极低酸度、高苦度/浓郁 | 冰滴、奶咖拼配 |\n\n> 💡 **RAG 考据备注**：选购生豆与匹配烘焙曲线时，请交叉参考 [[烘焙工厂与产地直采]] 以及 [[咖啡店日常运营手册]] 中的 Dial-in 参数表。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "📷 OCR 图文识别文本 [识别置信度: 99.4% | 原图来源: 咖啡豆烘焙度图鉴.png]\n\n## 咖啡豆烘焙阶段与风味演变曲线\n\n咖啡豆在烘焙过程中经历脱水、一爆（First Crack）、美拉德反应与二爆（Second Crack），不同烘焙程度的风味表现差异巨大：\n\n| 烘焙程度 | 英文名称 | 核心风味特征 | 酸度/苦度表现 | 适合萃取方式 |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **浅度烘焙** | Light / Cinnamon | 花香、柑橘、高锐度果酸 | 高酸度、极低苦度 | 手冲、虹吸壶 |\n| **中度烘焙** | Medium / City | 坚果、焦糖、巧克力平衡 | 中等酸度、适中甜感 | 美式、SOE 意式 |\n| **深度烘焙** | Dark / French | 烟熏、可可、香料、油脂丰富 | 极低酸度、高苦度/浓郁 | 冰滴、奶咖拼配 |\n\n> 💡 **RAG 考据备注**：选购生豆与匹配烘焙曲线时，请交叉参考 [[烘焙工厂与产地直采]] 以及 [[咖啡店日常运营手册]] 中的 Dial-in 参数表。"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "📷 OCR Text Extraction [Confidence: 99.4% | Source Image: Roast_Level_Diagram.png]\n\n## Coffee Bean Roasting Stages & Flavor Evolution Curve\n\nCoffee beans undergo dehydration, First Crack, Maillard reaction, and Second Crack during roasting. Flavor profiles vary significantly across roast spectrums:\n\n| Roast Level | English Designation | Key Flavor Attributes | Acidity / Bitterness | Recommended Brewing |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **Light Roast** | Light / Cinnamon | Floral, citrus, bright crisp acidity | High acidity, minimal bitterness | Pour-over, Syphon |\n| **Medium Roast** | Medium / City | Nutty, caramel, balanced chocolate | Balanced acidity & sweetness | Americano, SOE Espresso |\n| **Dark Roast** | Dark / French | Smoky, dark cocoa, rich body | Low acidity, pronounced bold bitter | Cold Drip, Milk Espresso |\n\n> 💡 **RAG Cross-reference**: When matching roast curves for bean procurement, cross-check against [[Roasting Factory & Origin Sourcing]] and the Dial-in table in [[Coffee Shop Daily Operations Manual]]."
          }
        },
