    "demo.snippet.coffeeVoiceProcure": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "🎙️ Voice-to-Text Transcript [Recording Duration: 03:45 | Accuracy Confidence: 98.6%]\n\n## 1. Core Commercial Espresso & Grinder Procurement List\n\n- **Espresso Machine**: La Marzocco Linea PB 2-Group Espresso Machine (with dual PID temp control and auto-backflush group heads). Budget capped at ¥85,000.\n- **Espresso Grinders**: Mahlkönig E65S GBW (Grind-by-Weight with millisecond electronic dosing). Quantity: 2 units, Budget ¥38,000.\n- **Single-Origin Grinder**: EK43S All-around Commercial Grinder (White Limited Edition) for SOE beans, Budget ¥22,000.\n\n## 2. Water Filtration & Conditioning System\n\n- **Whole-Store Filtration**: Commercial BWT dual soft-water filter system maintaining TDS between 75-120 ppm to prevent boiler scaling.\n\n## 3. Auxiliary Equipment & Bar Tools\n\n1. Smart dual-door undercounter refrigerated workbench (1.8m) x2 units.\n2. Puqpress Q3 Gen 5 auto tamper, Acaia Pearl timer scales x3 sets.\n3. Budget Summary: Hardware total ~¥165,000. 40% initial payment with 12 monthly installments. See [[Coffee Bean Supply Chain Cost Breakdown]]."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "🎙️ 语音转文字速记 [录音时长: 03:45 | 识别置信度: 98.6%]\n\n## 1. 核心意式与研磨设备采购清单\n\n- **意式咖啡机**：La Marzocco Linea PB 双头意式咖啡机（配 PID 控温系统与自洁冲煮头），预算控制在 ¥85,000 以内。\n- **意式磨豆机**：Mahlkönig E65S GBW（按重研磨，支持毫秒级电子定量），采购数量 2 台，预算 ¥38,000。\n- **单品手冲磨豆机**：EK43S 全能型磨豆机（白色特别版），用于单品 SOE 豆研磨，预算 ¥22,000。\n\n## 2. 净水与水质调节系统\n\n- **全店净水方案**：3M / BWT 商业双重软水滤芯组，确保 TDS 值稳定在 75-120 ppm，防止咖啡机锅炉结垢。\n\n## 3. 辅助设备与前台器具\n\n1. 智能冷藏双门平冷工作台（1.8米） x2 台。\n2. 突破者三阶定量填压器、计时电子秤（Acaia Pearl） x3 组。\n3. 预算总结：硬件设备总计约 ¥165,000，预计首付款 40%，其余分 12 期付清。详见 [[咖啡豆供应链成本拆解]]。"
          }
        },
