    "demo.snippet.survey": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "# ☕ Coffee Shop Daily Operations Standard SOP Manual\n\n> This manual serves as an operational baseline guide covering morning setup, espresso dial-in calibration, extraction standards, customer complaint responses, and closing procedures. Please read alongside [[Independent Cafe Survival Guide]] and [[Third Space Design Principles]].\n\n## 1. Morning Opening Preparation (07:30 - 08:00)\n\n1. **Water & Electric Safety Inspection**: Check soft water system inlet pressure (Standard: 0.3 - 0.4 MPa). Turn on the La Marzocco dual-group espresso machine and grinder for preheating.\n2. **Hygiene & Inventory Count**: Verify stock of milk, fresh dairy, syrups, and packaging against the threshold in [[Coffee Equipment Procurement List]].\n\n## 2. Espresso Dial-in Calibration Standards\n\nA minimum of 2 quality control dial-ins must be conducted before opening daily. Test data must be logged into the daily operations journal:\n\n| Parameter Indicator | Light Roast (Ethiopia/Kenya) | Medium-Dark Roast (Blend/Colombia) | Tolerance Range |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **Dose** | 19.5 g | 18.0 g | ± 0.2 g |\n| **Yield** | 42.0 g | 36.0 g | ± 1.0 g |\n| **Extraction Time** | 27 s | 25 s | ± 2 s |\n| **TDS Yield** | 9.2% - 9.8% | 9.8% - 10.5% | - |\n\n> ⚠️ **Quality Control Note**: If ambient humidity exceeds 70%, adjust the grinder to a finer step. Refer to [[Glossary: What is Coffee Roast Level]] for flavor profiles.\n\n## 3. Third Space Service & Complaint Response\n\n- Adhere to [[Third Space Design Principles]], keeping background music volume between 45-55 dB.\n- For Wi-Fi or power outlet issues, guide customers to the shared workspace area and issue drink upgrade vouchers."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "# ☕ 咖啡店日常运营标准 SOP 手册\n\n> 本手册为门店日常运营的指导性规范，覆盖晨间开店、设备校准、标准萃取、客诉响应及闭店结算流程。请配合 [[独立咖啡馆生存指南]] 与 [[第三空间设计原则]] 共同执行。\n\n## 一、 晨间开店准备（07:30 - 08:00）\n\n1. **水电路与设备安全检查**：检查软水系统进水压力（标准：0.3 - 0.4 MPa），开启意式磨豆机与辣妈双头咖啡机预热。\n2. **卫生与物料盘点**：确认牛奶、鲜奶、糖浆及包材库存，参考 [[咖啡设备采购清单]] 的预警线。\n\n## 二、 意式浓缩萃取校准标准（Dial-in）\n\n每日开店前必须进行至少 2 次品控校准，测试数据需填入每日运营日志：\n\n| 参数指标 | 偏浅烘焙（埃塞/肯尼亚） | 中深烘焙（拼配/哥伦比亚） | 允许误差范围 |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **粉量 (Dose)** | 19.5 g | 18.0 g | ± 0.2 g |\n| **萃取液重 (Yield)** | 42.0 g | 36.0 g | ± 1.0 g |\n| **萃取时间 (Time)** | 27 秒 | 25 秒 | ± 2 秒 |\n| **金杯萃取率 (TDS)** | 9.2% - 9.8% | 9.8% - 10.5% | - |\n\n> ⚠️ **品控提示**：若环境湿度大于 70%，需调细磨豆机研磨度格刻度。具体风味走向请查阅 [[词条：什么是咖啡豆烘焙度]]。\n\n## 三、 第三空间服务与客诉响应\n\n- 遵守 [[第三空间设计原则]]，确保背景音乐音量控制在 45-55 分贝之间。\n- 对于网络与插座异常问题，优先引导顾客至共享办公区，并赠送饮品升级券包。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "# ☕ 咖啡店日常运营标准 SOP 手册\n\n> 本手册为门店日常运营的指导性规范，覆盖晨间开店、设备校准、标准萃取、客诉响应及闭店结算流程。请配合 [[独立咖啡馆生存指南]] 与 [[第三空间设计原则]] 共同执行。\n\n## 一、 晨间开店准备（07:30 - 08:00）\n\n1. **水电路与设备安全检查**：检查软水系统进水压力（标准：0.3 - 0.4 MPa），开启意式磨豆机与辣妈双头咖啡机预热。\n2. **卫生与物料盘点**：确认牛奶、鲜奶、糖浆及包材库存，参考 [[咖啡设备采购清单]] 的预警线。\n\n## 二、 意式浓缩萃取校准标准（Dial-in）\n\n每日开店前必须进行至少 2 次品控校准，测试数据需填入每日运营日志：\n\n| 参数指标 | 偏浅烘焙（埃塞/肯尼亚） | 中深烘焙（拼配/哥伦比亚） | 允许误差范围 |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **粉量 (Dose)** | 19.5 g | 18.0 g | ± 0.2 g |\n| **萃取液重 (Yield)** | 42.0 g | 36.0 g | ± 1.0 g |\n| **萃取时间 (Time)** | 27 秒 | 25 秒 | ± 2 秒 |\n| **金杯萃取率 (TDS)** | 9.2% - 9.8% | 9.8% - 10.5% | - |\n\n> ⚠️ **品控提示**：若环境湿度大于 70%，需调细磨豆机研磨度格刻度。具体风味走向请查阅 [[词条：什么是咖啡豆烘焙度]]。\n\n## 三、 第三空间服务与客诉响应\n\n- 遵守 [[第三空间设计原则]]，确保背景音乐音量控制在 45-55 分贝之间。\n- 对于网络与插座异常问题，优先引导顾客至共享办公区，并赠送饮品升级券包。"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "# ☕ Coffee Shop Daily Operations Standard SOP Manual\n\n> This manual serves as an operational baseline guide covering morning setup, espresso dial-in calibration, extraction standards, customer complaint responses, and closing procedures. Please read alongside [[Independent Cafe Survival Guide]] and [[Third Space Design Principles]].\n\n## 1. Morning Opening Preparation (07:30 - 08:00)\n\n1. **Water & Electric Safety Inspection**: Check soft water system inlet pressure (Standard: 0.3 - 0.4 MPa). Turn on the La Marzocco dual-group espresso machine and grinder for preheating.\n2. **Hygiene & Inventory Count**: Verify stock of milk, fresh dairy, syrups, and packaging against the threshold in [[Coffee Equipment Procurement List]].\n\n## 2. Espresso Dial-in Calibration Standards\n\nA minimum of 2 quality control dial-ins must be conducted before opening daily. Test data must be logged into the daily operations journal:\n\n| Parameter Indicator | Light Roast (Ethiopia/Kenya) | Medium-Dark Roast (Blend/Colombia) | Tolerance Range |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **Dose** | 19.5 g | 18.0 g | ± 0.2 g |\n| **Yield** | 42.0 g | 36.0 g | ± 1.0 g |\n| **Extraction Time** | 27 s | 25 s | ± 2 s |\n| **TDS Yield** | 9.2% - 9.8% | 9.8% - 10.5% | - |\n\n> ⚠️ **Quality Control Note**: If ambient humidity exceeds 70%, adjust the grinder to a finer step. Refer to [[Glossary: What is Coffee Roast Level]] for flavor profiles.\n\n## 3. Third Space Service & Complaint Response\n\n- Adhere to [[Third Space Design Principles]], keeping background music volume between 45-55 dB.\n- For Wi-Fi or power outlet issues, guide customers to the shared workspace area and issue drink upgrade vouchers."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "# ☕ Coffee Shop Daily Operations Standard SOP Manual\n\n> This manual serves as an operational baseline guide covering morning setup, espresso dial-in calibration, extraction standards, customer complaint responses, and closing procedures. Please read alongside [[Independent Cafe Survival Guide]] and [[Third Space Design Principles]].\n\n## 1. Morning Opening Preparation (07:30 - 08:00)\n\n1. **Water & Electric Safety Inspection**: Check soft water system inlet pressure (Standard: 0.3 - 0.4 MPa). Turn on the La Marzocco dual-group espresso machine and grinder for preheating.\n2. **Hygiene & Inventory Count**: Verify stock of milk, fresh dairy, syrups, and packaging against the threshold in [[Coffee Equipment Procurement List]].\n\n## 2. Espresso Dial-in Calibration Standards\n\nA minimum of 2 quality control dial-ins must be conducted before opening daily. Test data must be logged into the daily operations journal:\n\n| Parameter Indicator | Light Roast (Ethiopia/Kenya) | Medium-Dark Roast (Blend/Colombia) | Tolerance Range |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **Dose** | 19.5 g | 18.0 g | ± 0.2 g |\n| **Yield** | 42.0 g | 36.0 g | ± 1.0 g |\n| **Extraction Time** | 27 s | 25 s | ± 2 s |\n| **TDS Yield** | 9.2% - 9.8% | 9.8% - 10.5% | - |\n\n> ⚠️ **Quality Control Note**: If ambient humidity exceeds 70%, adjust the grinder to a finer step. Refer to [[Glossary: What is Coffee Roast Level]] for flavor profiles.\n\n## 3. Third Space Service & Complaint Response\n\n- Adhere to [[Third Space Design Principles]], keeping background music volume between 45-55 dB.\n- For Wi-Fi or power outlet issues, guide customers to the shared workspace area and issue drink upgrade vouchers."
          }
        },
